      "layering_notes": "The largest regional nonprofit lender in the footprint. Footprint confirmed from Just Funded posts: Santa Clara, San Mateo, Alameda, Contra Costa, Santa Cruz, Monterey, Sonoma and, since about 2024, Sacramento County (three loans). Use for predevelopment and acquisition before TCAC/CDLAC awards; loans repay at construction or permanent closing. Housing Trust is also a Golden State Acquisition Fund originator and partners with FHLBank San Francisco on Affordable Housing Program grants (for example $2 million for 2700 International, Oakland). Separate records cover the Apple Affordable Housing Fund, Supportive Housing Fund (Santa Clara County), Monterey Bay Housing Trust and Sonoma County Housing Fund. Private capital, so no prevailing wage trigger from this source alone.",
