      "funding_type": "loan",
      "typical_award_size": "Term up to 35 years (terms over 20 years reset the rate at year 16); amortization up to 35 years; rate lock up to 42 months; loan to value up to 85% for LIHTC properties and 80% non-LIHTC; minimum DSCR 1.15 LIHTC and 1.20 non-LIHTC; $10,000 application fee plus origination of the greater of 1% or $15,000; conversion at 95% occupancy for 90 days with 90% of tax credit equity funded; prepayment greater of yield maintenance or 1% until 90 days before maturity. Terms last updated September 2026. Recent regional loans: The Starling, Oakland (Eden Housing, 70 senior units, $6,721,000); Solaire Apartments, San Jose (January 2025, tax-exempt loan with 4% LIHTC); Creekside Trails, San Diego (October 2024 bridge loan).",
      "per_unit_cap": null,
      "affordability_requirement": "Multifamily rental housing affordable to low income families, seniors and residents with special needs; mixed income properties at least 51% affordable at 80% AMI or below.",
