        "preservation"
      ],
      "application_cycle": "rolling",
      "next_deadline": "Rolling.",
      "prevailing_wage_trigger": "false",
      "layering_notes": "CCRC lends through a taxable mortgage pool funded by member banks and by directly purchasing tax-exempt bonds, which gives member banks CRA credit. It uses one set of pre-negotiated construction-to-permanent documents with Wells Fargo, U.S. Bank, First Citizens Bank, JPMorgan Chase and Bank of America, so pairing a CCRC forward commitment with one of those construction lenders shortens closing. Appraisal is shared with the construction lender. Statewide footprint with Bay Area, Sacramento Valley and San Diego deals in its portfolio.",
      "source_url": "https://www.e-ccrc.org/lending",
      "record_id": "1bb74728a3",
